There are fourteen native poses per candidate in the full review. This smaller phone ZIP selects the opening, +3, +6, +10, +20, left, right, deep and the final in-stage pose, and includes all three complete movies. The separate PDF offers one large picture on each page. Both experiments await your visual approval. Claudia's retained branch and original images are protected.

